WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.799 --> 00:00:06.519
Speaker 1: And another thing that Trump might
need containment for is his recently announced

00:00:06.519 --> 00:00:12.519
January six commemorative press conference
that he's going to be holding down in South

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:15.120
Florida this week.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.960
Trump did, in fact, announce that he is going
to hold this big press conference, give a

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.909
big old speech.

00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:27.169
On the anniversary of the Jan. six Capitol
riot.

00:00:27.169 --> 00:00:32.189
This is going to be held at Mar a Lago, all
all of the major media outlets will most likely

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:35.250
be there, which I happen to think is a big
mistake.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:41.870
I think the best way to handle this upcoming
speech is to totally ignore it and pretend

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:44.129
it doesn't exist.

00:00:44.129 --> 00:00:46.649
Don't give him the air time.

00:00:46.649 --> 00:00:47.969
Absolutely.

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:49.539
Do not make him feel important.

00:00:49.539 --> 00:00:52.230
That is the best thing the media outlets could
do.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:55.640
And the reason they should do this is because
we already know what kind of drivel he's going

00:00:55.640 --> 00:01:00.859
to be spewing at us during this little press
conference or whatever it is you want to call

00:01:00.859 --> 00:01:01.859
it.

00:01:01.859 --> 00:01:06.810
And we know that because he basically gave
us his talking points in his announcement.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:08.770
Here it is.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:14.220
Why isn't the UN Select Committee of Highly
Partizan political hacks investigating the

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:20.050
cause of the Jan. six protest, which was the
rigged presidential election of 2020?

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:24.450
I will be having a news conference on January
6th at Mar a Lago to discuss all of these

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.540
points and more.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:30.500
Until then, remember the insurrection took
place on November 3rd.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:36.110
It was the completely unarmed protest of the
rigged election that took place on January

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.310
6th.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.710
All right.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:42.170
So we're going to hear some more election
lies.

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:45.640
Maybe he's got some new ones to throw out
there, I don't know.

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:49.850
You know, it'd be great to have a remix of
the greatest hits instead of him just going

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:55.570
out there and playing the same old songs that
we all know so well.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:00.560
But the downplaying of the events that took
place on January 6th.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.530
That's the real problem.

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:07.110
And of course, he's doing that, I believe,
because he's gearing up for a presidential

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:11.430
run and he wants these people back in his
corner.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:15.390
And he may have already lost some of them
because we have had plenty of reports over

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:16.610
the past year.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:17.610
They're mad.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.730
They didn't get presidential pardons.

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:19.730
They're mad.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.420
He's not helping pay their legal bills.

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:25.110
They're mad that he hasn't stuck up for them
more over this past year.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:28.280
So this might be his way of trying to atone
for that.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:33.030
Although with regards to presidential pardons,
you really missed your opportunity on that

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:34.450
one, buddy.

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:38.060
So I don't know how many of these people are
willing to come back to you.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:42.730
I know most of them likely will, but some
of them clearly won't.

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:49.620
But the danger lies in what he's going to
say, because he's going to, as he tells us

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:54.790
here, try to claim that these people were
just peaceful protesters, they weren't armed,

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.090
they didn't deserve any of this.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:03:00.090
Of course, you can bet we're going to hear
stuff about Ashli Babbitt.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:05.870
And how she was murdered by police officers
and how these bloodthirsty cops just shot

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.080
her in cold blood.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:11.920
And for the record, I do not think that Ashli
Babbitt should have been killed.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:12.920
Absolutely not.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:17.090
Yeah, it doesn't matter who the cops are killing,
I'm against it.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:22.510
So I do think that Ashley Babbitt should still
be alive today.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:28.130
So too, for the record, should the police
officers that were there?

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:32.100
Because that's the port these conservatives
always like to gloss over, they like to talk

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.100
about Ashli Babbitt.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.780
But we got multiple cops.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.040
Where's their concern for that?

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:43.060
Where's the Blue Lives Matter crowd on that
issue, right?

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:44.260
Nowhere to be found.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:48.120
Radio silence from those individuals.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:53.069
And one of the reasons I also believe that
Donald Trump is doing this is because he sees

00:03:53.069 --> 00:03:55.680
the walls closing in over here.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:01.110
With that select committee investigation or
is he hilariously called it the UN Select

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:04.290
Committee who burn?

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.530
No, that's that's childish.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:11.130
I can take that to my seven year old, and
I promise you he could come back in five minutes

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:17.659
with 10 better insults for the committee if
he wanted to go that route.

00:04:17.659 --> 00:04:20.599
But the committee is getting closer.

00:04:20.599 --> 00:04:25.279
The committee is getting closer to Donald
Trump, the sentences that we're starting to

00:04:25.279 --> 00:04:29.669
see handed down for these Capitol rioters
are getting longer.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:31.669
They're getting more intense.

00:04:31.669 --> 00:04:38.560
The judges this past summer were telling prosecutors,
You're being too lenient on these individuals.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.590
You're letting them off for lesser charges.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:44.300
We can get them on more and we should to prove
a point.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:48.939
But most importantly, Trump knows that that
committee is getting closer to him personally.

00:04:48.939 --> 00:04:57.020
So he feels the best path forward for him
is to go out there with this press conference

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:02.070
that again, the media should ignore, but they
won't.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.189
He's going to go out there, he's going to
lie about what happened, he's going to downplay

00:05:05.189 --> 00:05:09.319
it, he's going to attempt to rewrite history
a year after we all watched it unfold on our

00:05:09.319 --> 00:05:11.490
TVs.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.449
But he's not doing it to protect the rioters.

00:05:14.449 --> 00:05:19.419
He's not doing it because he feels any kind
of sympathy towards these individuals.

00:05:19.419 --> 00:05:21.610
He's doing it.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:27.759
To make it seem like a lesser offense that
his office at least was attempting to overturn

00:05:27.759 --> 00:05:30.939
the results of the 2020 election.

00:05:30.939 --> 00:05:36.310
And of course, that's why we're going to get
mostly election lies out of him that day.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:41.219
You know, he has kind of been amped up about
all of that recently.

00:05:41.219 --> 00:05:45.449
And it is because his administration is being
exposed.

00:05:45.449 --> 00:05:51.199
We're finding out things because of the select
committee that we likely would have not otherwise

00:05:51.199 --> 00:05:52.199
known.

00:05:52.199 --> 00:05:56.139
We would not have known about the text messages
with Mark Meadows.

00:05:56.139 --> 00:06:00.059
We would not have known about the Fox News
host reaching out and panicking, Oh my God,

00:06:00.059 --> 00:06:03.050
you got to do something about these people.

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:09.370
So all of that combined has culminated in
Donald Trump feeling the need to go out there

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:13.789
and rewrite history for all of us and to get
not just the history of January 6th, but the

00:06:13.789 --> 00:06:16.680
