00:06:26.839 --> 00:06:29.810
almost all of it.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:33.900
Rests in the hands of Republican voters.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:41.029
Still, majority of Republicans believe the
2020 election was in fact stolen, so Trump

00:06:41.029 --> 00:06:47.569
